name 'pl-aif-2-U5-promise-chain_pl'
title 'title'
description 'description here'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Tracing the Promise Timeline

<p>In a full Promise chain., button click starts the request, <code style = "font-size:12pt";>fetch()</code> creates a Promise, and then <code style = "font-size:12pt";>.then()</code> / <code>.catch()</code> run later when the Promise settles.</p>

## Trace the Promise Chain

<div style="font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size:13pt; background:#0b1020; color:#e5e7eb; padding:16px; border-radius:10px; overflow:auto; max-width:900px; margin:12px 0; line-height:1.8;">
button click<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;→ fetch(url)<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.then(response =&gt; response.json())<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.then(data =&gt; /* use the data */)<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.catch(error =&gt; /* handle problems */)
</div>

<table style="border:1px solid #d8d5f5; border-radius:12px; background:#ffffff; max-width:900px; margin:12px 0; border-collapse:separate; width:100%; box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(31,25,118,0.08);">
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3" style="padding:14px 16px 8px 16px; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius:12px 0 0 0;">
      <span style="font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#1F1976;">What happens in order</span>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="width:36px; padding:10px 0 10px 16px; font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#4C42CF; vertical-align:top;">1</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;">Click starts the request</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0; font-size:14pt; line-height:1.55; vertical-align:top;">
      Your code begins running because an event happened (the user clicked).
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 16px; font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#4C42CF; vertical-align:top;">2</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;">
      <code style="font-size:12pt;">fetch()</code> returns <span style="display:inline-block; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:6px; background:#E4E2F8; color:#1F1976; font-size:12pt;">Pending</span>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0; font-size:14pt; line-height:1.55; vertical-align:top;">
      <code style="font-size:12pt;">fetch(url)</code> returns immediately with a Promise. The request is in progress, so it's <strong>pending</strong>.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 16px; font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#4C42CF; vertical-align:top;">3</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;">Handlers get registered</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0; font-size:14pt; line-height:1.55; vertical-align:top;">
      <code style="font-size:12pt;">.then()</code> and <code style="font-size:12pt;">.catch()</code> say "when this finishes, run this code." They don't run yet &mdash; they're just registered.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 16px; font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#4C42CF; vertical-align:top;">4</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;">
      Success → <span style="display:inline-block; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:6px; background:#ccf1d0; font-size:12pt;">Fulfilled</span>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 10px 0; font-size:14pt; line-height:1.55; vertical-align:top;">
      The first <code style="font-size:12pt;">.then()</code> runs with a <strong>Response</strong> object, usually converted with <code style="font-size:12pt;">response.json()</code>. Since that's also async, a <strong>second</strong> <code style="font-size:12pt;">.then()</code> runs once that data is ready.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 0 16px 16px; font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#4C42CF; vertical-align:top;">5</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px 16px 12px; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap;">
      Failure → <span style="display:inline-block; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:6px; background:#ffe3ce; font-size:12pt;">Rejected</span>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 16px 0; font-size:14pt; line-height:1.55; vertical-align:top;">
      If the request fails (or anything throws in the chain), the Promise is rejected and <code style="font-size:12pt;">.catch(error =&gt; ...)</code> handles it.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table style="border:1px solid #d8d5f5; border-radius:12px; background:#ffffff; max-width:900px; margin:12px 0; border-collapse:separate; width:100%; box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(31,25,118,0.08);">
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="padding:14px 16px 8px 16px; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius:12px 0 0 0;">
      <span style="font-weight:700; font-size:14pt; color:#1F1976;">What each part receives</span>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF;"><code style="font-size:12pt;">fetch(url)</code></td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; font-size:14pt;">A <strong>Promise</strong> (starts Pending)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF;"><code style="font-size:12pt;">.then(response =&gt; ...)</code></td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; font-size:14pt;">A <strong>Response</strong> (if fetch succeeded)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF;"><code style="font-size:12pt;">.then(data =&gt; ...)</code></td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; font-size:14pt;">The parsed <strong>data</strong> (often JSON)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 16px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; border-left:4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius:0 0 0 12px;"><code style="font-size:12pt;">.catch(error =&gt; ...)</code></td>
    <td style="padding:10px 16px 16px 16px; border-top:1px solid #f0f2f5; font-size:14pt;">An <strong>Error</strong> (if something failed)</td>
  </tr>
</table>



MARKDOWN
